Enterprise Content Collaboration refers to integrated digital platforms that enable organizations to create, edit, store, and share documents, forms, media and other collaborative data in real time across dispersed locations. These solutions combine robust file management, version control, permission based access, real time editing, workflow automation and analytics to support efficient, secure, cross functional collaboration at scale.
